&lt;h2&gt;Automatic refresh and more local panes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;File lists update after transfers and backups, and the local file browser splits into up to six panes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automatic refresh&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Uploads, downloads, copies between servers, new folders, and backups show up without a manual refresh.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More local panes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Split any local pane right or down, up to six panes. The layout is saved with workspaces.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translated tooltips&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Button tooltips that appeared in English are translated into Korean, Japanese, and Chinese.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class="notice"&gt;Close active sessions before updating. Requires macOS 13 or later on Apple Silicon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/PROMLEE/promeftp/releases/tag/v1.1.11"&gt;Read the full release notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
